8. Chapter 10 — Conclusion
The conclusion should summarize the project without introducing new information.

A suitable conclusion is:

FitBuddy-AI is an AI-powered fitness plan generation system designed to provide personalized workout recommendations based on individual user requirements. By integrating Gemini models with a web-based application, the system can generate structured workout plans, display exercise information, and support workout and progress tracking. The project demonstrates how generative AI can be integrated into a fitness application to provide personalized and interactive user experiences while maintaining appropriate validation and safety considerations.

